:"d203a4e8-ace6-4af5-9570-8aa561a0e4d9","type":"message","user":"US5UW1UNB","text":"TypeStrong/ts-expect を見ていたとき、ちょうど以下の書き方をしたいと ycino さんが言ってたなというのを思い出した。\n\n\n```import { expectNever } from \"ts-expect\";\n\ntype SupportedValue = \"a\" | \"b\";\n\nfunction doSomething(value: SupportedValue) {\n  switch (value) {\n    case \"a\":\n      return true;\n    case \"b\":\n      return true;\n    default:\n      return expectNever(value);\n  }\n}```","ts":"1635131836.162100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"UpE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"81df21e0-7cc5-49bf-b8b1-63e707b7c324","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"個人的には書きやすい方だと思ってる","ts":"1635130436.161400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MER"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bb123a55-8b36-49c4-8d7e-352730d14205","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"言うほどJSが書きやすいかというのは別として","ts":"1635130407.160900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"U65f/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b8e00dbe-6ddd-4c90-a56a-ba0c3861ddc8","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"JS覚えればVimプラグインもVSCode拡張もフロントもバックエンドも書けるのがコスパいい説","ts":"1635130386.160500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ItFGr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"556983a3-58ac-4506-99d2-0e5f54a35509","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"JSと剥離してるのがあかんのかな","ts":"1635130359.159900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rKxlJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"16bb4251-646b-49a2-99f9-a581c0e64420","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"Reasonはなんでやろなー、ほぼOCamlだしその筋の人には人気出そうなもんだけど","ts":"1635130335.159500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"l5X7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"380bebb4-a